    {
      "text": "Immemorial two heavens narration opens on Crescent Moon grotto-heaven as Xiao He Jian, Lady Cold Ash, and others look down on its dying owner in the ruins. Fairy Crescent Moon is the owner and holds terrain advantage, but she is outnumbered. After she is killed, Wu Shuai’s will praises Lady Cold Ash for the most contributions in the invasion and says rewards by contribution will follow. Qi Sea Ancestor later tells Granny Skeleton that Crescent Moon grotto-heaven has already fallen to Wu Shuai’s side and that Skeleton grotto-heaven is nearest to it.",
